WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:02.600
<i>Don't you dare start a fight without me!</i>

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:05.190
Aura is moving?!

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:06.440
Vox System has been activated!

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:09.820
Its CSR Border Line has already exceeded 100%.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.320
It's not responding to the A.I. Remote System, sir!

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:14.570
Full throttle from the get go, huh?

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.160
<i>Mr. Tadokoro!</i>

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:18.410
<i>I'll stop those two!</i>

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:19.490
Hold on a minute!

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:21.660
You haven't piloted that thing in nearly a year!

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.710
Distance between Lympha and Ignis, zero!

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:53.280
<i>Lympha's cockpit has been damaged!</i>

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:54.030
Lan!

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:56.030
<i>Pilot has lost consciousness!</i>

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>The craft is losing altitude!</i>

00:00:57.780 --> 00:00:58.990
Hurry, Midori!

