00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:32.140
Lan?

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:37.680
Why?

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:46.280
This place hasn't changed at all.

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:57.200
My locker... It's still here.

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:01.120
Madoka would never throw it out.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:02.790
You're right.

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:05.250
Say, Lan...

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:06.050
What is it?

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:10.300
Are you going to involve Madoka, no matter what?

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:14.140
What about you? You're trying to kill Madoka.

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:17.810
I'll never allow it!

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:19.980
I will protect Madoka!

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.810
You got a lot of nerve saying that.

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:24.480
You're trying to take advantage of Madoka!

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.940
You don't know anything!

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:30.610
If I don't do anything, Le Garite will use Madoka by force!

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:32.110
That's why I put myself between them!

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:35.580
See? You're just doing what your brother wants!

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:53.890
You know, Lan...

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:55.890
I came here to make sure of something.

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:59.720
It's why I came to this place where we three went together...

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:02.350
Back when the three of us were in the Jersey Club.

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:05.440
I came here to make sure of my feelings.

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:08.980
Me, kill Madoka?

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:11.070
I could never do that.

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:17.080
I mean, I like Madoka.

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:18.910
I love her!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:24.540
That's why I will not allow Madoka to become entangled in this!

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:26.500
Please leave.

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:30.760
And never come near Madoka again!

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:32.010
I refuse.

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:33.050
Lan!

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:35.130
I told you.

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:37.510
I am Madoka's guardian.

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:47.690
Madoka?

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:57.700
I knew it.

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:01.870
You two were here, after all!

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:04.580
M-Madoka?

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:06.170
Madoka?

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.790
You two...

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:10.880
You don't really want to fight, do you?

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:16.220
I heard your voices.

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:18.390
It wasn't too clear.

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:22.850
But I could feel the pain you two were going through.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:26.060
Because I felt it too. {timing check}

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:27.400
It was so sad.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:31.070
How did this happen?

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:32.280
Please tell me.

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:36.400
I'll do anything I can. Anything.

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:45.040
I'm sorry, Madoka.

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:46.080
Lan?

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:48.290
It's too late.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.040
Our planets...

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:54.920
Our brothers are beyond reaching an understanding.

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:58.720
Muginami?

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:02.970
There's nothing we can do anymore.

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:24.450
Wha—

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:28.500
If that's the case, then don't worry!

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:31.380
We can make your brothers become friends again.

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:32.630
I'll make them.

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:33.460
Like I did just now!

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:36.300
Then you two won't have to fight.

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.050
Let's try it!

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:41.430
To give up without even trying and fighting when you're against it

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:42.930
isn't the Jersey Club way!

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:46.720
The three of us together can do it!

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:50.390
Madoka...

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:54.940
Listen, Madoka. It isn't that simple.

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:00.860
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:03.200
I've made up my mind!

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:05.200
Muginami will rejoin the Jersey Club!

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:07.040
Muginami!

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:11.370
I haven't got a clue as to what we'll do.

00:19:11.370 --> 00:19:12.960
But the three of us...

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:17.510
The three of us together... I feel like we can pull it off.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:22.090
Didn't you just say you didn't want Madoka to get involved?

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:25.470
But now, I think something is possible.

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:27.010
Lan, you should join in too.

00:19:27.010 --> 00:19:28.140
Okay...

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:30.020
No, I can't! We don't have a plan!

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:31.690
No way! It's impossible!

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:34.190
You're starting to think it's going to work out, aren't you?

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:37.440
You're thinking it just might work.

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:38.400
Back off.

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:40.860
You're thinking it might just work!

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:42.950
You're thinking it might just work!

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:43.870
Enough!

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:46.080
Ow!

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:47.910
I-I'm sorry!

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:49.580
Hey Lan!

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:07.050
Haven't I always told you to keep a sharp eye on Madoka?

00:20:07.050 --> 00:20:10.180
How do you explain this, then?

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:12.520
We've been pretty busy.

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:14.150
We were careless.

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:17.570
Asteria, please don't scold them too much.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.610
I'm sure they've learned their lesson.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:24.070
Whose fault do you think this is?

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:26.120
Well...

00:20:26.570 --> 00:20:30.830
When I heard that Laffinty and Muginami had begun fighting in Kamogawa,

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:33.080
I did get a bad feeling about this.

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.670
I'm sorry.

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:35.630
I'm sorry...

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:42.630
We're being swamped with government inquiries from both nations.

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:44.760
Let me get straight to the point, then.

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:48.180
Both of you, seek asylum on Earth.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:50.680
That's the only way to avoid war.

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:52.560
Yes, ma'am.

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:54.310
Please help us.

00:20:57.230 --> 00:21:00.730
All right, you two! No time for idle thoughts!

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:03.990
You're back.

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:06.990
It sounded awfully noisy out here.

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:10.740
Your dear cousin has done it again.

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:13.200
I'm glad nothing has changed.

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:16.620
So?

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:20.500
Our measurements exposed the presence of Vox particles.

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:23.300
Same goes for the flower.

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:28.300
As we envisioned, the Vox may possess the potential to be more than a weapon.

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:33.100
If we can prove that, it could be the trump card to end this deadlock.

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:37.060
That's if I can make sure things run smoothly.

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:40.020
It's unlike you to sound so uncertain.

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:46.740
That's because I cannot risk the tragedy from 20,000 years ago repeating itself...

